CF TAMS Wasm adaptation (2026-10-23)
Copyright 2026 Livewyer Ltd

The Rust HTTP handlers, domain models, background jobs, canonical JSON and
query bindings are adapted from TASM revision
112c7a9e6e206ffbc528f5b0961e5eba432a010c. PostgreSQL queries are converted to
native SQLite, with exact ordered timestamp keys and per-instance host callbacks.
Cloudflare integration adds R2 signing and allocation incarnations, retained
physical cleanup, alarms, HTTP Basic/OAuth authentication and CORS.
Browser UI, PGlite and OPFS components are omitted. Source hashes are recorded
in provenance.json. See ../LICENSE (Apache-2.0).

